# Local agent tooling — binaries are machine-specific, not for the repo
tools/rtk
tools/rtk-cli
tools/*.tar.gz

# Retrieval feedback log — local observation, not repo state. Deliberately NOT
# under transaction-analytics/_gen/, which `vault check` compares for freshness:
# a file that mutates on every read would make the hook flap.
tools/vault/.log.tsv

# Context governor: live per-session measurement, and the cross-session trend.
# Same placement argument as the log above — mutates every turn, so it must stay
# out of _gen/, and it describes this machine's sessions, not the repo.
tools/vault/.ctx.json
tools/vault/.ctx.tsv

# Product-loop measurements (`vault evidence`). Derived from the transaction
# data on this machine, not from the repo — so it changes when the data changes,
# for reasons unrelated to any commit. The registry it runs
# (transaction-analytics/_metrics.tsv) IS repo state and is tracked.
tools/vault/.evidence.tsv
